        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "Metafield setup",
          "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_source == 'metafield_features_highlight' }}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "How to Create the Features Highlight Metafield:",
          "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_source == 'metafield_features_highlight' }}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "1. From your Shopify admin, go to Settings > Custom data. In the Metaobjects section, click Add definition. Name it 'Feature Highlight Item'. Add three fields in this order: (1) 'Label' (Single line text) - set as the Display Name, used only to identify the entry in the admin; (2) 'Icon' (Multi-line text) - holds SVG markup; (3) 'Title' (Single line text) - the visible caption shown under each icon on the page. Save.",
          "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_source == 'metafield_features_highlight' }}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "2. Back in Settings > Custom data, click Add definition in the Metaobjects section again. Name it 'Features Highlight'. Add three fields in this order: (1) 'Label' (Single line text) - set as the Display Name, used only to identify the entry in the admin; (2) 'Heading' (Single line text) - the visible section heading, can repeat across entries; (3) 'Features' (type Metaobject, reference 'Feature Highlight Item', tick List of entries, set minimum 3 / maximum 3). Save.",
          "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_source == 'metafield_features_highlight' }}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "3. Still in Settings > Custom data, click Products, then Add definition. Pick Custom definition. Name: 'Features Highlight'. Namespace and key: custom.features_highlight. Type: Metaobject, reference 'Features Highlight'. Save.",
          "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_source == 'metafield_features_highlight' }}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "4. Go to Content > Metaobjects, open 'Features Highlight', and click Add entry. Give it a Label (e.g. the product name), fill the Heading, then add 3 Feature Highlight Item entries (each with its own Label, an SVG Icon, and a short Title). Save the entry.",
          "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_source == 'metafield_features_highlight' }}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "5. Open a product. In the Metafields section, find 'Features Highlight', click Add reference, and select the entry you created in step 4. Save the product.",
          "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_source == 'metafield_features_highlight' }}"
        },
